<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Watchtower – Guides</title><link>https://gowatchtower.org/v1.22.2/notifications/guides/</link><description>Recent content in Guides on Watchtower</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><atom:link href="https://gowatchtower.org/v1.22.2/notifications/guides/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Signal Notifications</title><link>https://gowatchtower.org/v1.22.2/notifications/guides/signal/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://gowatchtower.org/v1.22.2/notifications/guides/signal/</guid><description>
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="overview"&gt;Overview&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="overview"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#overview" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Watchtower uses Shoutrrr&amp;rsquo;s &lt;a href="https://shoutrrr.nickfedor.com/services/signal/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Signal service&lt;svg class="hx:inline hx:rtl:rotate-270 hx:align-baseline" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&gt;
&lt;path d="m9.1716 7.7574h7.0711m0 0v7.0711m0-7.0711-8.4853 8.4853" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/&gt;
&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt; to send Signal notifications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Signal notifications require a Signal API server that can send messages on behalf of a registered Signal account.
This is typically done using &lt;a href="https://github.com/bbernhard/signal-cli-rest-api" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;signal-cli-rest-api&lt;svg class="hx:inline hx:rtl:rotate-270 hx:align-baseline" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&gt;
&lt;path d="m9.1716 7.7574h7.0711m0 0v7.0711m0-7.0711-8.4853 8.4853" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/&gt;
&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href="https://github.com/codeshelldev/secured-signal-api" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;secured-signal-api&lt;svg class="hx:inline hx:rtl:rotate-270 hx:align-baseline" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&gt;
&lt;path d="m9.1716 7.7574h7.0711m0 0v7.0711m0-7.0711-8.4853 8.4853" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/&gt;
&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
