&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="setting-up-a-signal-api-server"&gt;Setting up a Signal API Server&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="setting-up-a-signal-api-server"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#setting-up-a-signal-api-server" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Phone Number&lt;/strong&gt;: A dedicated phone number registered with Signal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;API Server&lt;/strong&gt;: A server running signal-cli with REST API capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Linking&lt;/strong&gt;: Linking the server as a secondary device to your Signal account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optional Security Layer&lt;/strong&gt;: Authentication and endpoint restrictions via a proxy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The server must be able to receive SMS verification codes during initial setup and maintain a persistent connection to Signal&amp;rsquo;s servers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="shoutrrrs-signal-url-format"&gt;Shoutrrr&amp;rsquo;s Signal URL Format&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="shoutrrrs-signal-url-format"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#shoutrrrs-signal-url-format" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;signal://[user:password@]host:port/source_phone/recipient1/recipient2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
